#NEXUS

[ soto-acuña2021a_fig3: Time-calibrated thyreophoran tree, 14 tips, fully resolved; four tips are collapsed clades (Stegosauridae, Nodosauridae, Ankylosaurinae drawn as wedges). Replacement case: drawn with seed 20261107 from the rectangular time-axis stratum after barrett2026a_fig28 was skipped. Topology transcribed from the figure and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=14;
    TAXLABELS
        Lesothosaurus
        Scutellosaurus
        Emausaurus
        Scelidosaurus
        Huayangosaurus
        Stegosauridae
        Kunbarrasaurus
        Antarctopelta
        Stegouros
        Nodosauridae
        Liaoningosaurus_paradoxus
        Gobisaurus_domoculus
        Shamosaurus_scutatus
        Ankylosaurinae
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE soto-acuña2021a_fig3 = [&R] (Lesothosaurus,(Scutellosaurus,(Emausaurus,(Scelidosaurus,((Huayangosaurus,Stegosauridae),((Kunbarrasaurus,(Antarctopelta,Stegouros)),(Nodosauridae,(Liaoningosaurus_paradoxus,(Gobisaurus_domoculus,(Shamosaurus_scutatus,Ankylosaurinae))))))))));
END;
